The best variant (threshold 0.6, top 3, stop 1.5 ATR) returned 56.6%.
That is the number a less careful write-up would report as 'the result'.
It is the maximum of 45 variants, and the multiple-comparison
correction in R/validate.R exists precisely to discount it.

